    "text": "By Earvin Adjei ,\n18 hours ago On Wednesday, the Connecticut Airport Authority (CAA) announced the reopening of Bradley Airport's Escape Lounge. The lounge was closed last summer due to an extensive expansion project and remodeling. The updated and now bigger space includes:. Larger footprint with increased seating capacity. More robust food and beverage menu due to... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
